<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE/CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE/CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English soccer matches</p>
<p>played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>League Cup third round replays</p>
<p> Lincoln	1  Southampton	3</p>
<p> Luton	  1  Wimbledon	  2 after extra time</p>
<p>(90 minutes 1-1)</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Barnsley     3  Norwich	    1</p>
<p>Division two</p>
<p> Shrewsbury   2  Bristol Rovers   0</p>
</text>
